[I] Device information and management D-Bus service for GNOME

[T] Deviced is a daemon that runs on a development device and allows IDEs and
[T] other tooling to interact with it over an authenticated, TLS secured
[T] connection. It ships a daemon, a library (libdeviced), and a devicectl
[T] command line tool.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/chergert/deviced

[A] Christian Hergert <chergert@redhat.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

